BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Category: Events\nInstructor: Britt R.\nLifting Socials are casual fitness area meetups hosted by a rotating cast of Movement team members. Each meetup is inspired by the host's favorite things and may include themed music\, snacks\, lift recommendations\, and other fun surprises. Attending these meetups earns you a raffle ticket for our Summer Swoletice strength challenge - stop by or call the front desk for more information.\nhttps://portal.movementgyms.com/portland/programs/summer-swolestice-lifting-social?course=U2Vzc2lvbjoyNDgyOTQ1MjA=&date=2026-08-20
